      "oscilloscope_label": "Oscilloscope",
      "aria_oscilloscope": "Muuqaalka oscilloscope circuit oo muujinaya raadadka voltage, current, iyo caji capacitor",
      "physics_resistor_how": "Electrons way ku dhacaan atomka ku jira agabka resistor-ka, iyagoo u beddelaya tamarta korontada kulayl. Isku dhac badan (resistance badan) macnaheedu waa current yar ayaa socda.",
      "physics_resistor_analogy": "Sida qaybta cidhiidhiga ah ee tuubada - way xaddidaysaa socodka biyaha wayna abuurtaa farqiga cadaadiska.",
      "comp_light_bulb": "Bulb",
      "physics_bulb_how": "Current-ku wu kululeeyaa wire khafiif ah (filament) ilaa ~2,500°C ilaa uu caddaan u dhalaalo. Resistance-ka filament-ku wu kordhaa marka kulaylku kordho.",
      "physics_bulb_analogy": "Sida gacmahaaga oo si dhaqso ah isku masaxaad - iskujirka (resistance) wu abuuraa kulayl iyo iftiin.",
      "physics_switch_how": "Farqi jireed oo ku jira conductor-ka. Marka la xiro electrons si xor ah ayay u socdaan. Marka la furo resistance-ka farqiga hawada wu ku dhow yahay mid aan dhammaad lahayn, isagoo gebi ahaanba joojinaya current-ka.",
      "physics_switch_analogy": "Sida buundo la kiciyo - marka la kiciyo waxba ma gudbaan. Marka la dejiyo taraafikadu way socotaa.",
      "physics_led_how": "Semiconductor diode oo sii daaya photons marka electrons ka soo dhacaan band tamar sare oo u dhacaan mid hoose. Agab kala duwan ayaa soo saara midabbo kala duwan.",
      "physics_led_analogy": "Sida albaab hal dhinac ah oo iftiin leh - electrons way tegi karaan hal jiho oo keliya, wayna sii daayaan iftiin markay gudbaan.",
      "physics_ammeter_how": "Wu cabbiraa current isagoo ogaanaya magnetic field-ka ay abuuraan electrons socda. Waa lagu xiraa series si current-ka oo dhan uu uga dhex maro. Internal resistance-kiisu aad buu u yar yahay.",
      "physics_ammeter_analogy": "Sida albaab wareega oo tiriya dadka intee gudba ilbiriqsigii.",
      "physics_voltmeter_how": "Wu cabbiraa farqiga xaalada (voltage) inta u dhaxaysa laba dhibic. Waa lagu xiraa parallel oo leh internal resistance aad u sarreeya si uusan u saameyn circuit-ka.",
      "physics_voltmeter_analogy": "Sida gauge cadaadis oo ku yaal tuubada biyaha - wu cabbiraa cadaadiska isagoon joojin socodka.",
      "physics_capacitor_how": "Laba saxan oo bir ah oo insulator kala qaybiyo. Electrons way isku ururaan hal saxan wayna ka tagaan kan kale, iyagoo tamar ku kaydiya electric field. Way si dhaqso ah u sii daayaan tamarta marka la faaruqiyo.",
