      "wall_visual_proof_of_equivalence": "Deyr — caddaynta muuqaal ee isu-simidka",
      "stack_the_fraction_wall_1_whole_2_halv": "Isku dul-dhig deyrka qeybta: 1 dhan = 2 badhabo = 4 rubuc = 8 sideed-meelood. Dherer isku mid = qiime isku mid. Ulaha Cuisenaire (1952) tan waxay ka dhigeen mid taabasho ah; deyrku waa faraca dijitalka.",
