      "pilot_fly_one_parcel_through_every_form_wate": "Duuli hal xabbad dhammaan qaababka ay biyuhu yeeshaan",
      "pilot_form_cloud_label": "Daruur",
      "pilot_form_cloud_science": "Balaayiin dhibco oo kula mid ah ayaa wada firdhiya dhammaan hirarka iftiinka, taasina waa sababta daruurtu u cad tahay. Kulaylka qarsoon ee aad sii daysay markaad uumi-baxday ayaa hadda kululaynaya xabbadda oo kor u riixaya iyada oo keliya.",
      "pilot_form_droplet_label": "Dhibic daruureed",
      "pilot_form_droplet_science": "Waxaad ku uumi-guduurtay xabbad boodh, cusbo ama qiiq ah: xudun uumi-guduurin. Waxaad le'eg tahay ilaa 20 mikromitir, oo ah shan meelood meel ballaca timo bini'aadam, oo waxaad khafiif u tahay in aad hawada ku sii jirto.",
      "pilot_form_groundwater_label": "Biyaha dhulka hoostiisa",
      "pilot_form_groundwater_science": "Heerka biyaha hoostiisa waxaad ku dhex socotaa godad isku xidhan oo dhagax ah, badanaa dhawr mitir sanadkii. Biyaha dhulka hoostiisa ma aha webi dhulka hoostiis ah: waa dhagax qoyan, wuxuuna biyo hayn karaa kumanaan sano.",
      "pilot_form_ice_label": "Xabbad baraf ah",
      "pilot_form_ice_science": "Heerka barafoobidda ka sarreeya waxaad noqotay xabbad baraf ah oo lix gees leh. Barafku uumiga biyaha si ka yar ayuu u hayaa marka loo eego biyaha, sidaas darteed waxaad ku korto dhibcaha kharashkooda: waa habka Bergeron, oo ka dambeeya roobka badankiisa meelaha ka baxsan kulaylaha.",
      "pilot_form_liquid_label": "Biyo dareere ah",
      "pilot_form_liquid_science": "Waxaad tahay biyo dareere ah oo dusha sare ah, oo ay isku hayaan xidhiidhka haydarojiinta. Molekuyuulada sare had iyo jeer way baxaan oo way soo noqdaan; uumi-bax wuxuu dhacaa marka kuwa baxaa ay ka badan yihiin kuwa soo noqda.",
      "pilot_form_plant_label": "Geed gudihiis",
      "pilot_form_plant_science": "Timo xidideed ayaa ku nuugtay, waxaana hadda kugu soo jiidaya marinnada biyaha ee geedka, iyadoo ay sabab u tahay cadaadiska ay abuurto biyaha markay ka uumi-baxaan caleemaha kor kaaga ah: dun biyo ah oo joogto ah oo dhawr mitir dheer.",
      "pilot_form_rain_label": "Dhibic roob",
      "pilot_form_rain_science": "Waxaad ku dhacday oo aad ku biirtay dhibco ku filan si ay cuf-jiidashadu uga adkaato hawada kor u kacaysa. Hal dhibic roob waa ku dhawaad malyan dhibco daruureed, taasina waa sababta daruuruhu saacado u joogi karaan ka hor inta uusan roobku di'in.",
      "pilot_form_runoff_label": "Biyo dusha sare mara",
      "pilot_form_runoff_science": "Waxaad u soo dhacday si ka dheereysa intii dhulku ku nuugi lahaa, sidaas darteed waxaad dusha sare kaga soo dareertaa xagga hoose ee tog. Biyaha dusha sare mara waxay qaadaan carro iyo wax kasta oo dusha dhulka saaran.",
      "pilot_form_snow_label": "Xabbad baraf cad",
      "pilot_form_snow_science": "Waxaad ka soo dhex dhacday hawo ay qabowgu ka hooseeyay eber jidka oo dhan, sidaas darteed waligaa ma dhalaalin. Laan kastaa waxay ku kortay isla xaaladaha isla xilligaas, taasina waa waxa ka dhigaysa xabbad barafeed mid isku eg.",
      "pilot_form_soil_label": "Biyaha ciidda",
      "pilot_form_soil_science": "Waxaad gashay godadka u dhexeeya xabbadaha ciidda. Xawaaruhu wuxuu ku xidhan yahay dhex-marista: ciidda bacaadka ah dhaqso ayay ku nuugtaa; dhoobada iyo waddooyinka shubka ah waxay kugu celiyaan biyo dusha sare mara.",
      "pilot_form_transpiring_label": "Neefsasho geed",
      "pilot_form_transpiring_science": "Waxaad ka baxaysaa dalool ku yaal caleenta hoosteeda oo mar kale uumi baad noqonaysaa. Geedaha ayaa qayb weyn oo roobka dhulka ku da'a hawada ku celiya sidan.",
      "pilot_form_vapor_label": "Uumiga biyaha",
      "pilot_form_vapor_science": "Waxaad tahay gaas, biyaha gaaska ahna waa la arki karo: caddaanka aad ku aragto kirli korkeeda ama daruur gudaheeda waa horeba dareere uumi-guduurtay. Waxaad kor u kacdaa sababtoo ah hawada diiran ee qoyan way ka fudud tahay hawada qallalan.",
      "pilot_free_convection": "KICID XOR AH",
      "pilot_free_convection_2": "kicid xor ah",
      "pilot_free_convection_3": "Kicid xor ah",
      "pilot_freezing_level": "HEERKA BARAFOOBIDDA",
      "pilot_freezing_level_2": "Heerka barafoobidda",
      "pilot_freezing_short": "barafoobid",
      "pilot_fwd": "Hore",
      "pilot_heavy_enough_gravity_wins": "Waad ku filan tahay culays — cuf-jiidashadu way guulaysatay",
      "pilot_humidity": "Qoyaanka",
      "pilot_keep_collecting": "Sii ururi: {n} dhibco ilaa hadda",
      "pilot_ladder_km": "{n} km",
      "pilot_loops_many": "{n} wareeg oo dhammaystiran",
      "pilot_loops_one": "{n} wareeg oo dhammaystiran",
      "pilot_model_note": "Sarreynta kor ku xusan waxaa loo xisaabiyay xaaladdan iyadoo la adeegsanayo heerarka caadiga ah ee hoos u dhaca heerkulka (deegaanka {env} °C/km, qallalan {dry} °C/km, qoyan {moist} °C/km) iyo isla'egta Espy ee heerka uumi-guduurinta. Masaafada iyo cabbirka dhibcaha muuqaalka waxaa loo sawiray cabbir waxbarasho, ma aha mid dhab ah.",
      "pilot_move_back_toward_the_camera": "Dib u soco, xagga kamaradda.",
      "pilot_move_forward_away_from_the_camera": "Hore u soco, kamaradda ka fogow.",
      "pilot_muted": "🔇 Aamusan",
      "pilot_needs_lift": "↓ Waxaad u baahan tahay kor u qaadis: {d} °C hawada ka qabow",
      "pilot_nucleus_found": "Xudun waa la helay",
      "pilot_obj_cloud": "Waxaad tahay daruur. Sii ururi si aad u culaysato oo ay cuf-jiidashadu ugu dambeyn uga adkaato hawada kor u kacaysa, ama hawada kor u kacaysa raac oo kor u sii bax oo barafow.",
      "pilot_obj_droplet": "Waxaad tahay dhibic daruureed. Ku dhac dhibcaha kale si aad u korto. Sii kor u bax: {m} m kulaylka qarsoon ee aad sii daysay ayaa ku sabbaynaya, oo mar dambe uma baahnid kor u qaadis.",
      "pilot_obj_droplet_free": "{m} m ka sareeya waxaad ka diirran tahay hawada ku hareeraysan, kor baadna u kacaysaa adigoo keliya: kaas waa kulaylka qarsoon ee uumi-guduurinta. Ku dhac dhibcaha kale si aad u korto.",
      "pilot_obj_droplet_nearly": "Sii ururi dhibcaha. Marka aad gaadho {n}, adiga iyo dhibcaha ku hareeraysan waxaad noqonaysaan daruur la arki karo.",
      "pilot_obj_groundwater": "Waxaad tahay biyo dhulka hoostiisa ah, waxaadna ku dhex socotaa godadka dhagaxa: mitiro sanadkii, ma aha ilbiriqsigii. Raadi il ama ceel si aad u soo noqoto.",
      "pilot_obj_ice": "Waxaad ka sarraysaa heerka barafoobidda, {m} m. Barafku wuxuu ka koraa si ka dheereysa dhibcaha ku hareeraysan: sii ururi, ka dibna soo dhac.",
      "pilot_obj_liquid": "Ku jir biyaha gaabban ee qorraxdu ku dhacayso. Iftiinka qorraxda, hawada qallalan iyo dabayshu dhammaantood waxay kugu buuxinayaan tamar ku filan si aad u baxdo uumi ahaan.",
      "pilot_obj_liquid_nearly": "Ku dhowaad uumi baad tahay: ku jir biyaha qorraxdu ku dhacayso ilaa uu xariiqa tamartu buuxsamo.",
      "pilot_obj_plant": "Xidid ayaa ku nuugtay. Kor ugu bax marinnada biyaha ilaa caleen.",
      "pilot_obj_rain": "Waxaad u soo dhacaysaa roob. U jiheyso biyo furan, dhul biyo mara, ama geed: mid kastaa wuxuu kugu diraa jid kala duwan.",
      "pilot_obj_runoff": "Ma aadan geli karin dhulka, sidaas darteed dusha sare ayaad ku socotaa xagga tog. Raac jiirka hoos u socda.",
      "pilot_obj_snow": "Waxaad u soo dhacaysaa baraf. Haddaad ka hoos gudubto {m} m waad dhalaalaysaa oo roob baad noqonaysaa jidka.",
      "pilot_obj_soil": "Waad gashay ciidda. Hoos ugu sii dhaadhac heerka biyaha, ama u oggolow xidid inuu ku nuugo.",
      "pilot_obj_transpiring": "Waxaad ka baxaysaa dalool caleen. Daqiiqad gudaheed mar kale uumi baad noqonaysaa oo wareeggu wuu ku celcelinayaa.",
      "pilot_obj_vapor_climb": "Kor u bax. {m} m hawadu waxay u qaboowday barta sayaxaaga, uumi-guduurinna way bilaaban kartaa: hal mitir ka hooseeyana maya.",
      "pilot_obj_vapor_nucleus": "Waxaad ka sarraysaa saldhigga daruurta oo waad qoyan tahay, laakiin uumiga biyuhu waxba kuma uumi-guduuro. U duul xudun uumi-guduurin: burburka boodhka iyo cusbada badda ee hawada ku dhex sabbaynaya.",
      "pilot_one_flight_cannot_reach_every_stage_wh": "Hal duulimaad kuma gaadhi karo dhammaan marxaladaha: meesha aad ku soo degto ayaa go'aamisa jidka aad qaadanayso. Mar kale duul oo meel kale ku soo deg.",
