      "watershed_recovery": "Watershed Recovery",
      "the_watershed_is_healing_across_the_bo": "Watershed-ku wuu bogsanaya dhinac walba. Headwaters way qaboobyihiin oo nadiif yihiin. Mainstem-ku mar kale kalluun buu sido. Beaver wetlands ayaa qabanaya shaqada floodplain. Sidaas ayaa watershed-scale recovery u eg tahay marka timing iyo community isku yimaadaan.",
