      "most_components_are_improving_a_few_st": "Components-ka badankood way soo hagaagyihiin. Dhawr weli shaqo bay u baahanyihiin. Jihada way fiican tahay oo community-gu wuu ka qeybqaadanaya.",
      "mixed_recovery": "Mixed Recovery",
      "some_wins_some_gaps_real_watershed_wor": "Guulo qaar, farqi qaar. Watershed work runta ah marar dhif ah bay isku mid noqotaa; qaybo baa soo hagaagay halka kuwo kale istaageen.",
      "slipping_watershed": "Slipping Watershed",
      "average_quality_is_low_and_few_compone": "Quality celceliska hooseeya oo components yar baa gaadhay recovery thresholds. Sidaas ayaa watersheds si aamusnaan ah u xumaadaan marka stewardship-ku ku gaari waayo pressures-ka.",
      "initial_conditions_look_workable_use_y": "Initial conditions way shaqeynaya u eg yihiin. Isticmaal Year 1 citizen-science monitoring iyo waxbarasho si aad u dhisto community support intaadan ku bixin ficillo laysku hayo sida dam removal.",
