      "for_authoritative_voices_on_maine_wate": " Codadka la aamini karo ee Maine watershed work, la tasho Penobscot Nation Cultural and Historic Preservation Department, Wabanaki Public Health and Wellness, Atlantic Salmon Federation, Maine Coast Heritage Trust, Maine Audubon, Maine Soil and Water Conservation Districts, iyo Maine Department of Environmental Protection.",
