      "quiz_912_1_fb1": "This rate is too low. The average environmental lapse rate in the troposphere is 6.5°C per kilometer.",
      "quiz_912_1_fb3": "This is the dry adiabatic lapse rate (9.8°C/km) for dry rising air, not the environmental profile.",
      "quiz_912_1_fb4": "This cooling rate is too high. The average atmospheric cooling is around 6.5°C per 1000m.",
