      "largest_moon_in_the_solar_system_bigge": "Dayaxa ugu weyn nidaamka qorraxda. Wuu ka weyn yahay Mercury! Wuxuu leeyahay beertiisa birlabeed.",
      "callisto": "Callisto",
      "most_heavily_cratered_object_in_the_so": "Jirka ugu god badan nidaamka qorraxda. Waxaa laga yaabaa inuu leeyahay bad hoose.",
      "titan": "Titan",
      "only_moon_with_a_thick_atmosphere_has_": "Dayaxa kaliya ee leh hawo qaro weyn. Wuxuu leeyahay harooyin iyo webiyo methane dareere ah!",
