      "charon": "Charon",
      "half_the_size_of_pluto_they_orbit_each": "Badhka cabbirka Pluto! Midba midka kale ayuu ku wareegaa (laba dwarf planet). Wuxuu leeyahay koofiyad guduudan oo cidhifka ah.",
      "no_atmosphere_stars_visible_even_durin": "Hawo ma jirto — xiddigaha waa la arki karaa xataa maalinta. Qorraxda aad bay u weyn tahay oo indhaha bay xanuujisaa.",
      "permanent_overcast_surface_bathed_in_d": "Daruur joogto ah. Dusha waxaa daboolay iftiin liidata oo oranji ah. Hillaac ayaa kor ka dhalaalaya.",
      "blue_sky_from_rayleigh_scattering_5_00": "Cir buluug ah oo ka yimid Rayleigh scattering. ~5,000 xiddig oo indhaha qaawan lagu arki karo.",
      "butterscotch_sky_from_iron_dust_blue_s": "Cir midab caramel ah oo ka yimid boodhka birta. Qorrax-dhac buluug ah! Phobos wuxuu soo baxaa 2 jeer maalintii.",
      "no_surface_from_cloud_tops_see_auroras": "Dusha ma jirto — koorka daruuraha, waxaad ka aragtaa aurora 100 jeer ka dhalaalaysa tan Dhulka.",
      "rings_visible_as_bright_arcs_overhead_": "Giraangiraha waxaa loo arkaa qaanso dhalaalaya oo kor ah. Titan: cir ceeryaan oranji ah, Saturn wuxuu u muuqdaa 11 jeer ka ballaadhan Dayaxaha buuxa.",
      "sun_just_a_very_bright_point_42_year_s": "Qorraxdu waa uun barr aad u dhalaalaya. Xilliyo 42 sano ah. Janjeerta xad-dhaafka ah waxay ka dhigaysaa in Qorraxdu cidhifyada kor ka joogto.",
      "sun_900x_dimmer_than_on_earth_still_30": "Qorraxdu 900 jeer ayay ka liidataa tan Dhulka. Weli waxay 300 jeer ka dhalaalaysaa Dayaxa buuxa ee Dhulka.",
      "charon_appears_7x_larger_than_our_moon": "Charon wuxuu u muuqdaa 7 jeer ka weyn Dayaxeenna. Midba midka kale ayuu ku xiran yahay — Charon wuxuu cirka ku taagan yahay isagoo aan dhaqaaqin.",
