      "venera_13_took_the_first_color_photos_": "Venera 13 wuxuu qaaday sawirradii midabka lahaa ee ugu horreeyay ee dusha Venus ka hor inta uusan kulaylka iyo cadaadisku hawlgalkiisa dhammayn.",
      "mariana_trench": "Mariana Trench",
      "deepest_point_on_earth_at_11_034_m_dee": "Barta ugu qoto dheer Dhulka oo ah qiyaastii 10,935 m — way ka qoto dheer tahay dhererka Everest.",
