      "hydrothermal_vent_field": "Goobta Hydrothermal Vent",
      "superheated_water_erupts_at_400_c_supp": "Biyo aad u kulul ayaa ka soo burqada 400°C, taasoo taageerta nolol aan iftiin qorrax lahayn.",
      "tube_worms_here_can_grow_to_2_4m_and_l": "Tube worm-yada halkan waxay gaadhi karaan 2.4m waxayna noolaan karaan 250+ sano iyagoo isticmaalaya chemosynthesis — iftiinka qorraxda looma baahna!",
      "coral_reef_colony": "Deegaan Coral Reef",
