      "coral_reefs_support_25_of_all_marine_s_2": "Sakhaannada coral waxay taageeraan 25% noocyada badda oo dhan inkastoo ay daboolaan wax ka yar 1% sagxadda badda.",
      "shipwreck": "Doon Quusatay",
      "a_sunken_vessel_colonized_by_marine_li": "Markab quusatay oo ay noolaha badda degeen — sakhaan macmal ah.",
      "there_are_an_estimated_3_million_shipw": "Waxaa lagu qiyaasaa 3 milyan oo markab quusatay sagxadda badda adduunka oo dhan. Qaar badan waxay noqdaan deegaanno hodan ah.",
      "olympus_mons_is_so_wide_624_km_that_st": "Olympus Mons aad buu u ballaadhan yahay (624 km) oo haddaad cidhifkiisa istaagto, dhaladiisa ma arki kartid — wuxuu ka jeexdaa cirifka aragga.",
      "it_would_stretch_from_new_york_to_los_": "Wuxuu fidi lahaa New York ilaa Los Angeles wuxuuna 5 jeer ka qoto dheer yahay Grand Canyon.",
      "if_all_of_mars_s_polar_ice_melted_it_c": "Haddii barafka cidhifyada Mars oo dhan uu dhalaali lahaa, wuxuu planet-ka oo dhan ku dabooli lahaa 11 mitir oo biyo ah.",
      "jezero_crater_where_nasa_s_rover_searc": "Jezero Crater — halka rover-ka NASA uu ka raadinayo calaamado nolol hore.",
      "perseverance_arrived_feb_2021_and_has_": "Perseverance wuxuu yimid Feb 2021 wuxuuna socday 28+ km, isagoo ururinaya muunado dhagax ah oo mustaqbalka Dhulka loo soo celinayo.",
      "an_anticyclonic_storm_raging_for_350_y": "Duufaan anticyclone ah oo socday 350+ sano, oo ka weyn Dhulka.",
      "wind_speeds_at_the_edge_reach_680_km_h": "Xawaaraha dabaysha cidhifka wuxuu gaadhaa 680 km/h — laba jeer xawaaraha hurikaanka ugu xoogga badan Dhulka.",
      "upper_cloud_layer_made_of_frozen_ammon": "Lakab daruur koor ah oo laga sameeyay kristaalo ammonia barafoobay oo -145°C ah.",
      "below_this_layer_are_ammonium_hydrosul": "Lakabkan hoostiisa waxaa yaal daruuro ammonium hydrosulfide ah, kuwaas hoostoodana daruuro biyo ah. Jupiter wuxuu leeyahay cimilo 3 lakab qoto dheer.",
      "zones_between_cloud_bands_where_convec": "Aagagga u dhexeeya xarriiqyada daruuraha halkaas oo convection uu kiciyo duufaanno hillaac weyn.",
      "jupiter_s_lightning_is_10x_more_powerf": "Hillaaca Jupiter wuxuu 10 jeer ka xoog badan yahay kan Dhulka wuxuuna inta badan ka dhacaa cidhifyada iyo daruuraha qoto dheer.",
      "deep_below_the_clouds_pressure_turns_h": "Daruuraha hoostooda ee qoto dheer, cadaadisku wuxuu hydrogen-ka u beddelaa bir dareere ah.",
      "this_metallic_hydrogen_ocean_generates": "Baddan hydrogen bir ah waxay abuurtaa beerta birlabeed ee Jupiter — 20,000 jeer ka xoog badan tan Dhulka.",
      "a_persistent_hexagonal_cloud_pattern_a": "Qaab daruur lix-gees ah oo joogto ah oo ku yaal cidhifka waqooyi ee Saturn.",
      "each_side_of_the_hexagon_is_about_14_5": "Dhinac kasta oo lix-geeska ah wuxuu dhererkiisu yahay qiyaastii 14,500 km — wuu ka ballaadhan yahay dhexroorka Dhulka.",
      "area_where_saturn_s_rings_cast_shadows": "Aagga ay giraangiraha Saturn hooska ku tuuraan koorka daruuraha.",
      "saturn_s_rings_are_only_about_10_m_thi": "Giraangiraha Saturn waxay qaro ahaan yihiin qiyaastii 10 m oo keliya inkastoo ay 282,000 km ballac yihiin — saami ahaan way ka khafiifsan yihiin daabad.",
      "titan_has_lakes_of_liquid_methane_and_": "Titan wuxuu leeyahay harooyin methane dareere ah iyo hawo ka qaro weyn tan Dhulka — waa dayaxa kaliya ee leh hawo la sheegi karo.",
      "at_8_000_km_depth_extreme_pressure_cru": "8,000 km qoto dheer, cadaadis xad-dhaaf ah ayaa carbon-ka u cadaadiya dheeman.",
      "these_diamonds_may_be_as_large_as_mill": "Dheemankan waxaa laga yaabaa inay le'eg yihiin malaayiin carat waxayna u soo daataan sida roob si ay lakab dheeman ah xudunta ugu samaystaan.",
      "uranus_s_magnetic_field_is_tilted_59_f": "Beerta birlabeed ee Uranus waxay 59° uga janjeertaa dhidibka wareegga.",
      "combined_with_the_98_axial_tilt_uranus": "Marka lagu daro janjeerta dhidibeed ee 98°, magnetosphere-ka Uranus si qas ah ayuu bannaanka ugu rogmadaa.",
      "faint_methane_cloud_bands_where_wind_p": "Xarriiqyo daruur methane ah oo khafiif ah halkaas oo qaababka dabayshu jihada beddelaan.",
      "uranus_appears_featureless_but_hubble_": "Uranus wuxuu u muuqdaa mid aan astaan lahayn laakiin Hubble wuxuu muujiyay nidaamyo daruur oo adag oo socda 900 km/h.",
      "a_massive_storm_system_similar_to_jupi": "Nidaam duufaan weyn oo la mid ah Great Red Spot ee Jupiter.",
      "unlike_jupiter_s_spot_neptune_s_dark_s": "Si ka duwan barta Jupiter, barooyinka madoow ee Neptune way muuqdaan oo way baabba'aan sanado gudahood — planet-ku si la yaab leh ayuu isu beddelaa.",
      "equatorial_winds_reaching_2_100_km_h_f": "Dabaylaha dhexroorka waxay gaadhaan 2,100 km/h — way ka dheereeyaan xawaaraha codka.",
      "neptune_generates_more_heat_than_it_re": "Neptune wuxuu soo saaraa kulayl ka badan kan uu Qorraxda ka helo, taasoo dabaylahan xad-dhaafka ah ka kicisa tamarta gudaha.",
      "the_path_of_triton_the_only_large_moon": "Jidka Triton — dayaxa weyn ee kaliya ee gadaal u wareega.",
      "triton_is_likely_a_captured_kuiper_bel": "Triton waxaa u badan tahay inuu yahay walax laga qabtay Kuiper Belt. Ilihiisa nitrogen-ka ah waxay tuuraan uumi 8 km sarreeya.",
      "the_famous_heart_shaped_glacier_made_o": "Barafka caanka ah ee qaabka wadnaha leh oo laga sameeyay baraf nitrogen iyo carbon monoxide.",
      "the_left_lobe_sputnik_planitia_is_a_va": "Qaybta bidix (Sputnik Planitia) waa bannaan baraf weyn oo leh unugyo convection ah oo si tartiib ah barafka u qasa.",
      "mountains_of_water_ice_rising_2_3_km_a": "Buuro baraf biyo ah oo 2–3 km ka sarreeya bannaanka nitrogen-ka.",
      "because_water_ice_is_less_dense_than_n": "Sababtoo ah barafka biyuhu wuu ka fudud yahay barafka nitrogen-ka heerkulka Pluto, buurahani run ahaantii way dabbaashaan.",
