      "magnitudes_count_backward_smaller_brig": "Magnitude-yada GADAAL ayaa loo tiriyaa: yaraanta = dhalaal badan. Tallaabo kasta oo 5 ah = 100× dhalaal badan. Hipparchus ayaa curiyay 130 BCE. Qorrax: -26.7. JWST wuxuu arkaa ilaa mag 34. Gaadhitaan: 100^((34-(-26))/5) ≈ 10^24 jeer ka liita Qorraxda.",
      "celestial_coordinate_systems": "🧭 Nidaamyada Coordinate-ka Cirka",
