      "astronomers_use_multiple_coordinate_sy": "Cirbixiyeennadu waxay isticmaalaan nidaamyo coordinate ah oo badan. Equatorial waa mid caalami ah walxuhuna isla coordinate ayay haystaan inta Dhulku wareegayo. Alt-Az had iyo jeer wuu isbeddelaa marka Dhulku wareego. Galactic ayaa ugu wanaagsan barashada qaab-dhismeedka Milky Way.",
      "big_numbers_in_astronomy": "🔢 Tirooyinka Waaweyn ee Cirbixiyeenimada",
