      "astronomy_operates_on_absurd_scales_ho": "Cirbixiyeenimadu waxay ku shaqaysaa cabbirro aan macquul ahayn. \"Immisa xiddig?\" — ka badan xabbadaha ciidda xeeb kasta oo Dhulka ah. \"Immisa jir?\" — 13.8 bilyan sano. Haddana tirooyin qaar (uumi-baxa godka madoow) way ka sii weyn yihiin.",
      "space_debris_tracker": "🛰 Raadraaca Qashinka Bannaanka",
      "36_500_objects_orbit_earth_at_various_": "36,500 walxood ayaa Dhulka ku wareega joogyo kala duwan. Dhaqaaji slider-ka joogga si aad u aragto waxa halkaas jooga.",
      "altitude_3": "Joog",
      "36_500_tracked_objects_millions_of_fra": "36,500 walxood oo la raadraaco + malaayiin jajab ah ayaa Dhulka ku wareega. Khatarta Kessler Syndrome: isku dhacyo isku xigxiga oo bannaanka ka dhigaya mid aan la isticmaali karin. SpaceX Starlink wuxuu leeyahay 5000+ dayax-gacmeed; wuxuu qorsheynayaa kuwo badan oo kale.",
      "constellation_mythology": "📜 Sheekooyinka Constellation-ka",
      "every_culture_sees_stories_in_the_star": "Dhaqan kastaa wuxuu xiddigaha ku arkaa sheekooyin. Laga bilaabo halyeeyada Giriigga ilaa Emu-ga Cirka ee Aborijiniska.",
