      "first_exoplanet_around_a_sun_like_star": "Exoplanet-kii ugu horreeyay ee ku wareegsan xiddig Qorrax u eg: 51 Pegasi b (1995). Hadda 6,300+ ayaa la xaqiijiyay. JWST wuxuu ku samaynayaa spectroscopy hawo exoplanet-yada — isagoo raadinaya biosignature-yo.",
      "upcoming_eclipses": "🌙 Madoobaadyada Soo Socda",
