      "color_harmony_discovery": "🎶 Helitaanka is-waafajinta midabka",
      "adjust_base_hue_saturation_lightness_v": "Habee hue-ga aasaasiga ah, saturation, kala-duwanaanta iftiinka, wareegga, iyo cabbirka palette-ka. Widget-ku wuxuu tusayaa palette is-waafajin oo toos ah, wuxuuna u kala saaraa shan nooc oo is-waafajin ah. Dhibco ma jiraan, jawaab la kashifayo ma jirto — iska bedbeddel oo eeg isku-darka noocee is-waafajin keenaya.",
      "log": "📋 Diiwaan",
      "reset": "↺ Dib u dhig",
      "hypothesis_free_text_no_right_answer_w": "Malo-awaal (qoraal xor ah — jawaab sax ah ma jirto): Maxaa palette ka dhiga mid is waafaqsan halkii uu ka noqon lahaa mid is diida?",
      "stuck_show_open_prompts_no_answers": "🤔 Waan istaagay — i tus su'aalo furan (jawaabo ma jiraan)",
      "open_prompts_investigate_by_manipulati": "Su'aalo furan — baadh adigoo iska bedbeddelaya:",
      "find_the_smallest_palette_that_still_f": "Hel palette-ka ugu yar ee wali kuu muuqda mid \"dhammaystiran\".",
      "real_impressionists_used_analogous_pal": "Farshaxamayaashii impressionist-ka waxay isticmaali jireen palette analogous. Maxay taasi u ahayd?",
      "some_color_schemes_have_proper_names_c": "Qorshayaal midab qaarkood magacyo gaar ah ayay leeyihiin (complementary, split-complementary, triadic). Raadi magacyadaas oo isku day inaad soo celisid.",
      "high_saturation_many_colors_busy_try_d": "Saturation sare + midabbo badan = mashquul. Isku day inaad saturation-ka ku yarayso slider-ka isku-darka — maxaa ku dhacaya \"is-waafajinta\"?",
      "i_think_i_understand_color_harmony_now": "Waxaan u malaynayaa inaan hadda fahmay is-waafajinta midabka — aan erayadeyda ku sharxo",
      "explain_in_your_own_words_how_do_hue_s": "Erayadaada ku sharax: sidee kala-fogaanta hue, saturation, iyo cabbirka palette-ka u go'aamiyaan \"is-waafajinta\"?",
      "design_note_discrete_5_state_harmony_m": "Xusuusin naqshadeed: calaamad is-waafajin oo shan xaaladood leh; giraangirta SVG waxay tusaysaa meelaha palette-ka; dhibco \"palette wanaagsan\" ma jiraan — sidaas ayaa loo qorsheeyay.",
