      "paint_behavior": "Dhaqanka rinjiga:",
      "real_spin_art_uses_centripetal_acceler": " Farshaxanka wareegga ee dhabta ahi wuxuu isticmaalaa dardargelinta bartame-u-jiidashada si uu rinjiga u faafiyo. Rinjiga khafiifka ahi si dhaqso ah buu dibadda ugu duulaa; kan qaro weyni wuxuu abuuraa raadad gaaban oo si fiican loo xakameeyay.",
