      "canvas_summary_macro": "Shaxda dhaqaalaha qaranka oo muujinaya kobaca GDP, qiim-koorid, heer dulsaar, shaqa-la'aan, dheelitirka ganacsiga, iyo taariikhda siyaasadda.",
