      "law_of_demand": "Sharciga Baahida: ",
      "as_price_quantity_demanded_consumers_b": "Marka qiimuhu ↑, tirada la baahan yahay ↓. Isticmaalayaashu wo yar gataan marka qiimuhu koro. Qalooca baahidu wo hoos u janjeeraa.",
      "law_of_supply": "Sharciga Sahayda: ",
      "as_price_quantity_supplied_producers_m": "Marka qiimuhu ↑, tirada la sahayo ↑. Soo-saarayaashu wo badan soo saaraan marka qiimuhu koor yahay. Qalooca sahaydu wo koor u janjeeraa.",
