      "changing_the_price_moves_along_a_curve": "Beddelka qiimuhu wo kaa dhaqaajiyaa QALOOCA DUSHIISA. Arrimaha dibadda (tignoolajiyad, dakhli, doorbid) wo WAREEJIYAAN qalooca oo dhan.",
