      "demand_shifted_right_more_people_want_": "▶ Baahidu wo u wareegtay MIDIG — Dad badan baa doonaya alaabtan (waxaa laga yaabaa in dakhligu koray, ama caan bay noqotay). Tani wo koorisaa qiimaha dheelitirka IYO tiradaba.",
      "demand_shifted_left_fewer_people_want_": "▶ Baahidu wo u wareegtay BIDIX — Dad yar baa doonaya alaabtan (beddel baa raqiisay, ama doorbidku wo isbeddelay). Qiim IYO tiro labaduba wo hoos u dhacaan.",
      "supply_shifted_right_producers_can_mak": "▶ Sahaydu wo u wareegtay MIDIG — Soo-saarayaashu wo si raqiis ah wax badan u soo saari karaan (tignoolajiyad cusub, kharash alaab oo hoos u dhacay). Qiimuhu wo hoos u dhacaa, laakiin tiradu wo kortaa.",
      "supply_shifted_left_production_became_": "▶ Sahaydu wo u wareegtay BIDIX — Wax-soo-saarku wo adkaaday (masiibo dabiici ah, xeerar). Qiimuhu wo koraa, laakiin tiradu wo hoos u dhacdaa.",
      "demand_flatter": " — fidsan, JIIDMO badan: iibsadayaashu wo si degdeg ah ugu jawaabaan qiimaha (raaxo, alaab beddel leh).",
      "demand_steeper": " — toosan, JIIDMO YAR: iibsadayaashu tirada si dhib leh bay u beddelaan marka qiimuhu dhaqaaqo (baahiyo lama huraan ah sida shidaal ama dawo).",
      "supply_flatter": " — fidsan, JIIDMO badan: soo-saarayaashu wo si fudud u koorin ama u hoosaysiin karaan wax-soo-saarka (alaab warshadeed).",
      "supply_steeper": " — toosan, JIIDMO YAR: wax-soo-saarka way adag tahay in si degdeg ah loo beddelo (guryo, beero, kuraas riwaayadeed).",
      "tax_incidence_1": " — \"fiil cashuur\" ayaa u dhexeeya waxa iibsaduhu bixiyo iyo waxa iibiyuhu hayo, ganacsiyo qaar oo labada dhinacba faa'iidayn lahaa wo joogsadaan (KHASAAR AAN SOO NOQON). Hadda iibsadayaashu wo qaadaan ~",
      "tax_incidence_2": "% cashuurta, iibiyayaashuna ~",
      "tax_incidence_3": "% — dhinaca JIIDMADA YAR (toosan) mar walba wo qaadaa qeybta badan. Rog jiidayaasha jiidmada oo daawo sida qeybsigu u dhaqaaqo.",
