      "vacuum_cleaner_city_traffic": "Vacuum cleaner, city traffic",
      "vampire_bats_have_infrared_sensing_pit": "Vampire bats have infrared-sensing pits on their nose that detect blood vessels under skin from inches away. This is convergent evolution with pit vipers!",
      "vision": "Vision",
      "vs_bat_wings_vs_bird_wings": "🦇 vs 🐦 Bat Wings vs Bird Wings",
