      "over_500_million_birds": "over 500 million birds",
      "owl_feathers_have_a_serrated_leading_e": "Owl feathers have a serrated leading edge, a velvety surface texture, and a fringed trailing edge that together reduce aerodynamic noise to near-silence. Engineers at GE and Dyson have mimicked these features in turbine blades and fan designs, reducing noise by 10+ decibels.",
