      "e_g_how_did_aldus_manutius_decide_what": "e.g. \"How did Aldus Manutius decide what books to print first?\" or \"What was a 1450 type-caster's daily routine?\"",
      "e_g_line_length_matters_most_because_s": "e.g., line length matters most because saccades break down past ~80 chars...",
