      "do_not_enter_the_water_unless_you_are_": "Do not enter the water unless you are a trained lifeguard or rescue swimmer. Panicked drowning victims grab anything that floats — including you — and push it under. The leading cause of death in would-be rescuers is being drowned by the person they tried to save.",
