      "to_learn_to_swim_or_get_certified_find": "To learn to swim or get certified, find a Water Safety Instructor (WSI) at the ",
      "torso_held_against_the_drain_by_suctio": "Torso held against the drain by suction. The most lethal type — adult-strength forces.",
