      "45_fixed_pipe_is_automatically_qualifi": " (45° fixed pipe) is automatically qualified for all easier positions. The reverse is not true.",
      "46_multiple_choice_visual_inspection_o": "46 multiple choice. Visual inspection of weld samples — identify defects, measure dimensions, apply acceptance criteria. Uses physical weld coupons in the test room. Inspector applies code criteria to actual welds.",
