      "decompression_sickness": "Decompression sickness",
      "deep_dive_into_maine_s_welding_economy": "Deep-dive into Maine's welding economy: Bath Iron Works (US Navy destroyers, 6,500+ employees), Cianbro, Pratt & Whitney, Maine Maritime Academy, EMCC + KVCC + SMCC welding programs, apprenticeship pathways, salary ranges by employer, Maine Apprenticeship Council, MaineWorks workforce programs. The real Maine welding career map.",
