      "diagonal_of_a_3_ft_4_ft_rectangle_3_4_": "Diagonal of a 3 ft × 4 ft rectangle = √(3² + 4²) = √25 = 5 ft. Square check: a frame that measures 3×4 should diagonal exactly 5 (or 5'-0\").",
