  "readinglib_opt1_body": "Buugag sawir StoryWeaver oo asal ah, qoraalkoodana daabacuhu xaqiijiyey. Qaar badan cod ayaa lagu akhriyey iyadoo erey-erey loo iftiiminayo. Isticmaal sifeeyaha luqadda ee kore.",
  "readinglib_opt1_title": "Buugta maktabadda — kuwa ugu kalsoonida badan",
  "readinglib_opt2_body": "Fur buug kasta oo guji 🌐 Turjun. Wuxuu xitaa ku shaqeeyaa luqadaha StoryWeaver uusan daabicin (Somali, Ukrainian, …), kor-u-akhriskuna wuu shaqeeyaa. AI ayaa qoraalka sameeyey — daabacuhu ma eeggin — akhriska erey-erey wuxuu ku jiraa asalka oo keliya. Maanta wuxuu ugu fiican yahay taageerada dadka cusub; markaad awooddo ardayda la barbardhig asalka.",
  "readinglib_opt2_title": "Turjumaad AI oo degdeg ah — luqad kasta, hadda",
  "readinglib_opt3_body": "StoryWeaver wuxuu ku daabacaa 300+ luqadood. Mid kasta maktabaddan ayaa lagu dari karaa isagoo leh qoraal la xaqiijiyey (iyo akhris cod halka uu jiro) iyadoo abka si degdeg ah loo cusboonaysiinayo — u sheeg maamulahaaga AlloFlow luqadda aad u baahan tahay.",
